    "body": "Ah right, yeah, good point. Separate methods are unfortunate but far less likely to break things.\r\n\r\nMay I propose:\r\n\r\n* `has(key)`\r\n* `hasValue(key, value)`\r\n* `delete(key)`\r\n* `deleteValue(key, value)`",
