    "created_at": "2023-02-16T15:14:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-16T15:14:45Z",
    "body": "If the plan is to go with `has()`/`delete()`, we should probably have a use counter. We could do this by adding a two-argument overload which would trigger the use counter and then call into the one-argument overload:\r\n```\r\nboolean has(USVString name);\r\nboolean has(USVString name, any ignored);\r\n```",
